    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [
        40,
        1120
      ],
      "size": [
        560,
        420
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 15,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "DIFFORUM - SEAMLESS LOOP (installations)\n\nLoop Blend crossfades, and on a projection that runs for hours the eye\nfinds that dissolve every cycle. Nothing is blended here - the clip is\ngenuinely periodic instead.\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n1. Camera Keys with loop_mode=harmonic projects the motion onto\n   components that are periodic over cycle_frames. The path returns\n   exactly to its origin AND the velocity matches across the wrap.\n2. Anim Setup renders 3 LAPS (360f) of the same 120f cycle. The first\n   two exist only so the feedback image can settle onto its cycle.\n3. Loop Take discards the early laps and returns the last one, with\n   no pixel touched.\n\nREAD seam_info ON LOOP TAKE\n  seam < 0.02  excellent      0.02-0.05  good\n  0.05-0.10    visible        > 0.10     poor\n  \"not settled yet\"  -> raise max_frames to 4 laps (480)\n  \"settled\" but seam shows -> lower harmonics to 2\n\nharmonics controls how much of the original move survives:\n  1  perfect seam, very simple motion\n  3  balanced (default)\n  6+ faithful to the shot list, seam may show\n\nCOST: 3 laps is 3x the render. You render once and project forever.\n\nMOVES THAT NEED A DEPTH MAP\n  dolly_in, dolly_out, orbit_left, orbit_right and sway drive camera\n  motion THROUGH space. The 2D affine warp cannot express that, and\n  the Feedback Sampler silently falls back to the 2D warp whenever\n  `depth` is not connected - even with mode set to 3d. Those moves\n  then render as a frozen frame, with nothing in the log to say why.\n\n  Flat moves that always work:\n    pan_left/right, pan_up/down, zoom_in/out, roll_cw/ccw,\n    spiral, dolly_zoom, rise, shake\n\n  For real parallax (near pixels moving faster than far ones) use\n  examples/advanced/difforum_parallax_fluid.json - it wires\n  Depth Anything V2 into the sampler.\n"
      ],
      "title": "READ THIS",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
  ],
